# 10. Testing and acceptance

Implement deterministic tests using mocked model responses.

Required scenarios:

1. Create a writing session from an existing research development.
2. Generate three editorial angles.
3. Select an angle and create a draft.
4. Revise a selected paragraph.
5. Preserve explicitly protected text.
6. Maintain immutable version history.
7. Compare two versions.
8. Restore an earlier version.
9. Reject unsupported claims.
10. Validate the selected draft version.
11. Invalidate validation after an edit.
12. Submit a specific validated version for human approval.
13. Prevent publication without existing explicit authorisation.
14. Recover writing sessions after an application restart.
15. Handle model errors, timeouts and malformed output without corrupting stored drafts.

Run all existing v0.3 regression tests.

